<title>UK: GrandMet up on positive press comment.</title>
<headline>GrandMet up on positive press comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in food and drink company Grand Metropolitan Plc rose in early trading on Monday, following a positive report in the Sunday Times on the company's plans to sell some European brands, traders said.</p>
<p>The Sunday Times Sharewatch column rated the shares a &quot;buy&quot; and noted that analysts had upgraded their 1997 forecasts for the company to 1.05 billion stg from 970 million stg.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3p at 488 by 0751 GMT.</p>
</text>
